    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>arg</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8745;</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "a portion of a circle centred at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;that lies in the second and third quadrants only",
      "is_correct": false
