    {
      "text": "a portion of a circle centred at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;that lies in the second quadrant only",
